OL,3,GNEWSAMurder accused says housemate
OL,4,A'threatened to kill him'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA student who stabbed his housemate to
OL,7,Fdeath was "terrified" after being told
OL,8,Fthey were "looking forward to killing
OL,9,Fhim".
OL,11,FZack Coughlan, 23, stabbed Jamie
OL,12,FCollins, 21, at their home in Filton,
OL,13,FBristol, on 8 April. Coughlan admits
OL,14,Fresponsibility for the attack but
OL,15,Fdenies murder on the grounds that he
OL,16,Ffeared for his life.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,438,430,260,140,0,100
