OL,3,GNEWSAMurder accused says housemate
OL,4,A'threatened to kill him'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSobbing while giving evidence during
OL,7,Fhis trial at Bristol Crown Court, the
OL,8,Fdefendant told the jury that Collins
OL,9,Finsisted he meant his threat, and
OL,10,FCoughlan locking his bedroom door
OL,11,F"wasn't going to help".
OL,13,FLater that same day, Coughlan ambushed
OL,14,FCollins, stabbing him 30 times and
OL,15,Fleaving him for dead, only to call the
OL,16,Fpolice eight hours later.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
